# Offline jobs vs agent git

Training, ACP, and eval on this CCI/k8s GPU server must never depend on Git
network or a clean worktree. Do not add `git status --porcelain` gates,
`require_clean_git`, dirty-tree attestation failures, origin URL probes, or
`scripts/cci_bootstrap.sh` connectivity tests.

When the user asks to commit, or when they have asked that new git changes be
committed automatically:

1. Create a local commit on the current branch.
2. Push to the tracked upstream (`git push -u origin HEAD` if needed).
3. Never force-push. If GitHub is unreachable, keep the local commit and
   report the real error.

Record a commit SHA only when local `git rev-parse` succeeds; if git is
unavailable, continue training without it.
